{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ad9aa97cd3c361cbb1ac7d5bfa6da843734bb9339865d7576edb3ea18926b198", "ja": "（作曲家さんにお願いしていた、新曲が届いた！\n杏奈は……控え室で、ゲーム中かな？）", "zh": "（拜托作曲家创作的新歌送到了！杏奈……现在该不会正在休息室里玩游戏吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "93189eaa7921fc577c4cd17431441edbd911e14aa1ea0ac8cc650de8052b0c9c", "ja": "みんなにも、やってみてほしい……\n本当に、すごいゲーム……だから……。", "zh": "好想让大家……也玩玩看……\n真的是……很厉害的游戏……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1d634fe0bf84957684fc98af4a648e89c143dc144fc5fa033e89e82fda56bc49", "ja": "お疲れさま、杏奈。\nあれ、取り込み中か？　なら後にしようかな。", "zh": "辛苦了，杏奈。\n咦，你正忙着吗？那我还是之后再来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "70f29965631600542fee8d4839be1b5dd6b5ea076b6598b0f51f5c3445c1e7d7", "ja": "ううん……平気、です。それに……\n{$P$}さんにも、聞いてほしい……。", "zh": "没关系……不要紧的。而且……\n我也想让{$P$}先生……听一听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ce5dcb8d3e0c1897f4b5b09daeec1a9177575371069c0fb7a584ca05176ef7ee", "ja": "聞いてほしい？", "zh": "想让我听听？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "dd8ffbacac1ff21d52f6739fb01b3e8300d25842a68972674ae071c158927786", "ja": "あのね……前に、{$P$}さんと、\nゲーム買いに行ったの……覚えてます、か……？", "zh": "那个……之前，和{$P$}先生一起去\n买游戏的事……你还……记得吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "3f1657cd6b073adecff51ed9e4a2bab36e8bac38c388f198e2cc60e620f3d571", "ja": "発売日なのに、売ってなくて……\n予約して、帰ったの……。", "zh": "明明是发售日，却没卖……\n只好先预订，然后回去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4a2305e67b8c3d65e22345c288cfeb648a2e714d43283d251c450578abb1f2c5", "ja": "ああ、発売延期になっちゃったっていう……\nもしかして、あのゲームが出たのか？", "zh": "啊，也就是说……发售延期了……\n难道是那款游戏发售了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "16554b68f1bd0ab9900c0c39037bc5cf927129a90a37c33889f3d81af071a9e9", "ja": "うん……そう……\n今度は、ちゃんと……出た……。", "zh": "嗯……是的……\n这次，真的……发售了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "1edaf4e635c5cd5682dc5cabab4552080c9dd324291f3fd158b2f370bda40e73", "ja": "開発に、時間が……すごく、かかって……\n発売……何度も、延期になった……。", "zh": "开发花了……非常久的时间……\n发售……延期了好多次……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "068841960b4f81de869fd8f5c104efef9600cf06adcc0ef1d04f2aaaecdd9cc7", "ja": "もしかしたら、このまま出ないかも……\nそう、思ったこともある……くらい。", "zh": "我还甚至一度以为……\n搞不好……就这样不会发售了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "aed945fddce2d6dd3f51506d5245b09bb734618ce4c68cc1d60a8f89292c79ed", "ja": "なるほど～！　そのゲームがようやく出たので、\n杏奈ちゃんは徹夜でプレイした、というコトですね！", "zh": "原来如此～！也就是说，那款游戏终于发售了，所以杏奈熬夜玩了个通宵，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "174ebd067ee7b6949b183a5ab19cc7a122cfcfca5ee021d4991e1789c73800e5", "ja": "うん……でも、待ってたかい、あった……\n……すごく、面白くて……。", "zh": "嗯……不过，等得很值得……\n……真的，非常有意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "e126f9940d86795da3deb064517a8cb70f59651ae12bc719b9705b161665ab87", "ja": "気づいたら……朝に、なってました……\nふわ……。", "zh": "回过神来……已经到早上了……\n呼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5637c1f6a4e8ee15b5b5b8fb32fe654ddf94acf6b2eee8c7b5f7c6ff2ccbf1b5", "ja": "という事は……杏奈、徹夜なのか？\nダメじゃないか、ちゃんと寝なくちゃ。", "zh": "也就是说……杏奈，你熬夜了？\n这可不行，得好好睡觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "f6cb6dde607b9c904872f130cd1e7f5372015069c9666ab2692f98ee28e146ac", "ja": "はい……気をつけ、ます……。", "zh": "好的……我会注意……睡觉的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "14df9d7d2acbbf6c0f1de9f439e7c80b4c2a50c0cfce3d192fd30e1b6fcc70a3", "ja": "アンナ。そのゲームは、そんなに\nインタレスティングなんですか？", "zh": "安娜。那个游戏真的有那么有趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "002e8744dcf0d110998dd10f2f5325e59053ec9cabd631a44ecd5088b5502af0", "ja": "アンナをそこまで夢中にさせるゲーム、\nロコも気になります！", "zh": "能让杏奈如此着迷的游戏，ROCO也令我很感兴趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "09495cafb1e92d371985fe77928f1e1bf6d948a0fd953c5b0b04d8fe3cfe5d7c", "ja": "たしかに……杏奈ちゃん！\nありさも、杏奈ちゃんの隣でゲームがしたいです！", "zh": "确实……杏奈！亚利沙也想在杏奈旁边玩游戏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "1093e46b695140a68e76cda5fa7203502bff6c5b377c53455aeffb7897a04e68", "ja": "いいけど……ダメ……。", "zh": "可以是可以……不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "a32d9a6589b50f82992ae7bfc6c23e030fbd39f0efec3835fae5885df755fc15", "ja": "どっちなんですか？", "zh": "到底是可以还是不可以？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "2867773b088f2a55b4035769307027f2144e6d145782339ea8a2d2e087450050", "ja": "これ……続編、だから……前作、プレイしないと……\n真の楽しみは、わからない……。", "zh": "这个……是续作，所以……不玩前作的话……\n就体会不到真正的乐趣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "8d65d441d8da5126768317b667d7e0c83761891e3f63045f264861caf5e159d3", "ja": "続編……なるほど、なるほど！　たしかに\nアイドルちゃんも、1stは抑えるのが鉄板ですから！", "zh": "续作……原来如此，原来如此！确实，偶像们也都是先把第1作掌握好，这是基本操作嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "fa1b402b34e6900ca1f7f05170dfe7d200303cf9a4535c739493f87791319b72", "ja": "アートを見るのも、ヒストリーやバックグラウンドを\n知っている方がアシミレートできますしね。", "zh": "欣赏艺术时，了解其历史和背景也更容易吸收呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "2c8abe6b3a5dc5eb0f2f9d9b28a464192faacacb3943d732b66ebb3ef4b6048b", "ja": "そういうことですよね？　アンナ。", "zh": "是这么回事吧？安娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "e5acd2821e868dff0b766b66b3377e605af7a7d681a1cd07ddb829b35037a730", "ja": "え……。\n何言ってるか、よくわかんない……。", "zh": "诶……。\n不太明白你在说什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "ddf2d5f9df92546f1d457827b47f3be7c45d39da0f6ff52b25a001e7af548b5a", "ja": "ええー！？\nどうしてですかー！？", "zh": "诶诶——！？\n为什么呀——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1027_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "f0fa205dbda455a35558da1d6d1882bdaf3f98d2e12f51430950e7f786cbaa8a", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん。\n何か、お話があるとうかがったんですけど……。", "zh": "早上好，{$P$}先生。\n我听说您有话要说…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1029_p", "source_sha256": "18a779276bae1b719e669af9a593702d055b5073d006dc7315b03206c5bff249", "ja": "あ、そうだった。\n先に話そうと思って、すっかり忘れてたな。", "zh": "啊，对了。\n我本来想先说来着，结果完全忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "1f710e59b8a9370726f1f78cf31456e0b8ba99228e0f8db6b0d94c4f584178b1", "ja": "もう。桃子たちを呼び出しておいて、\n忘れてたってどういうこと？", "zh": "真是的。把桃子她们叫过来，\n结果却给忘了是怎么回事嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "f441157f71d805d3c9a3e0c2edc61999a1057abc5484f79a7306e088cdf7c7fd", "ja": "今日は、次の公演の打ち合わせでしょ？\n杏奈さんの新曲お披露目だったよね。", "zh": "今天不是要商量下一场公演的事吗？\n是杏奈姐姐的新歌首次亮相吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8aee4b127d65a8560d74d01dc89c05ca50f7b9b81c44d1c7463bd4805845bdc1", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。その新曲が届いたから、\nみんなにも早速聞いてもらおうと思って。", "zh": "啊，对。新曲已经送到了，\n所以想让大家马上听听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "7cd81431345d5c1f6b260c1f322d77f03b311250d36b6e07d7ff7f167e07aeb8", "ja": "杏奈の……新曲……。", "zh": "杏奈的……新歌……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "ed8dc760b046a9277e23c42fce1f75cf1f7c7aa0bd05f94cdec705f15fcc3def", "ja": "ふおおおお……！\nこの曲……杏奈ちゃんに、ピッタリだと思います！", "zh": "呜哦哦哦哦……！\n我觉得这首歌……简直太适合杏奈了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1036_052kao", "source_sha256": "b1f3c2449d8d4ec3e5195c256332803794dbaa7a49095b7d085789e23ce71466", "ja": "ええ。アップテンポなのに、可愛らしさもあって……\nライブが盛り上がりそうですね。", "zh": "嗯。虽然是快节奏的歌曲，却也很可爱……\n演唱会一定会热闹起来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1037_025roc", "source_sha256": "9d0eff9e62cd29a3bd51a8844aaf41ca6c7a9f34b1ab9eba527e7844f73fc2da", "ja": "歌詞がユニークですね！　デジタルとサイバーが\nフュージョンして……とにかく、クールですよ♪", "zh": "歌词很独特呢！数字风和赛博风融合在一起……总之，感觉很酷哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "15ca742093bd250d847bfab815823d7bfb24dcea5cecead2fecd3533d4d44978", "ja": "うん、いいんじゃない？\nセットリストの他の曲とも、雰囲気が違う感じだし。", "zh": "嗯，挺好的吧？\n而且跟歌单里的其他歌曲比起来，感觉氛围也不太一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1039_p", "source_sha256": "71346523858877ca0da26decadb33faab55dc1cb1394a125439d2a1d3bf05c09", "ja": "どうだ、杏奈？　気に入ったか？", "zh": "怎么样，杏奈？喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_062_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "8ef6e189ae70fe336257f3e2d14d4724fb8b729b7dabfe27c991fbb718e25c33", "ja": "はい……すごく、カッコイイ……です……。\nこれが……杏奈の、新曲……。", "zh": "是……非常帅气……。\n这就是……杏奈的新歌……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
